ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja471:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja471:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja471:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja471:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja471:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja471:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja471:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja471:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja471:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja471:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja471:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja471:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja471:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja471:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja471:13.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja471:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja471:0.2": "Dvādasakanipāta ", "ja471:0.3": "Cūḷakuṇālavagga ", "ja471:0.4": "8. Meṇḍakapañhajātaka ", "ja471:1.1": "“Yesaṁ na kadāci bhūtapubbaṁ, ", "ja471:1.2": "Sakhyaṁ sattapadampimasmi loke; ", "ja471:1.3": "Jātā amittā duve sahāyā, ", "ja471:1.4": "Paṭisandhāya caranti kissa hetu”. ", "ja471:2.1": "“Yadi me ajja pātarāsakāle, ", "ja471:2.2": "Pañhaṁ na sakkuṇeyyātha vattumetaṁ; ", "ja471:2.3": "Raṭṭhā pabbājayissāmi vo sabbe, ", "ja471:2.4": "Na hi mattho duppaññajātikehi”. ", "ja471:3.1": "“Mahājanasamāgamamhi ghore, ", "ja471:3.2": "Janakolāhalasaṅgamamhi jāte; ", "ja471:3.3": "Vikkhittamanā anekacittā, ", "ja471:3.4": "Pañhaṁ na sakkuṇoma vattumetaṁ. ", "ja471:4.1": "Ekaggacittāva ekamekā, ", "ja471:4.2": "Rahasi gatā atthaṁ nicintayitvā; ", "ja471:4.3": "Paviveke sammasitvāna dhīrā, ", "ja471:4.4": "Atha vakkhanti janinda etamatthaṁ”. ", "ja471:5.1": "“Uggaputtarājaputtiyānaṁ, ", "ja471:5.2": "Urabbhassa maṁsaṁ piyaṁ manāpaṁ; ", "ja471:5.3": "Na sunakhassa te adenti maṁsaṁ, ", "ja471:5.4": "Atha meṇḍassa suṇena sakhyamassa”. ", "ja471:6.1": "“Cammaṁ vihananti eḷakassa, ", "ja471:6.2": "Assapiṭṭhattharassukhassa hetu; ", "ja471:6.3": "Na ca te sunakhassa attharanti, ", "ja471:6.4": "Atha meṇḍassa suṇena sakhyamassa”. ", "ja471:7.1": "“Āvellitasiṅgiko hi meṇḍo, ", "ja471:7.2": "Na ca sunakhassa visāṇakāni atthi; ", "ja471:7.3": "Tiṇabhakkho maṁsabhojano ca, ", "ja471:7.4": "Atha meṇḍassa suṇena sakhyamassa”. ", "ja471:8.1": "“Tiṇamāsi palāsamāsi meṇḍo, ", "ja471:8.2": "Na ca sunakho tiṇamāsi no palāsaṁ; ", "ja471:8.3": "Gaṇheyya suṇo sasaṁ biḷāraṁ, ", "ja471:8.4": "Atha meṇḍassa suṇena sakhyamassa”. ", "ja471:9.1": "“Aṭṭhaḍḍhapado catuppadassa, ", "ja471:9.2": "Meṇḍo aṭṭhanakho adissamāno; ", "ja471:9.3": "Chādiyamāharatī ayaṁ imassa, ", "ja471:9.4": "Maṁsaṁ āharatī ayaṁ amussa. ", "ja471:10.1": "Pāsādavaragato videhaseṭṭho, ", "ja471:10.2": "Vitihāraṁ aññamaññabhojanānaṁ; ", "ja471:10.3": "Addakkhi kira sakkhikaṁ janindo, ", "ja471:10.4": "Bubhukkassa puṇṇaṁmukhassa cetaṁ”. ", "ja471:11.1": "“Lābhā vata me anapparūpā, ", "ja471:11.2": "Yassa medisā paṇḍitā kulamhi; ", "ja471:11.3": "Pañhassa gambhīragataṁ nipuṇamatthaṁ, ", "ja471:11.4": "Paṭivijjhanti subhāsitena dhīrā. ", "ja471:12.1": "Assatarirathañca ekamekaṁ, ", "ja471:12.2": "Phītaṁ gāmavarañca ekamekaṁ; ", "ja471:12.3": "Sabbesaṁ vo dammi paṇḍitānaṁ, ", "ja471:12.4": "Paramappatītamano subhāsitenā”ti. ", "ja471:13.1": "Meṇḍakapañhajātakaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja471:0.1": "", "ja471:0.2": "", "ja471:0.3": "", "ja471:0.4": "", "ja471:1.1": "", "ja471:1.2": "Sakhyaṁ → sakkhiṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); sakhi (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja471:1.3": "", "ja471:1.4": "", "ja471:2.1": "", "ja471:2.2": "", "ja471:2.3": "", "ja471:2.4": "", "ja471:3.1": "", "ja471:3.2": "", "ja471:3.3": "", "ja471:3.4": "", "ja471:4.1": "", "ja471:4.2": "atthaṁ nicintayitvā → atthāni cintayitvā (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja471:4.3": "", "ja471:4.4": "", "ja471:5.1": "", "ja471:5.2": "", "ja471:5.3": "", "ja471:5.4": "", "ja471:6.1": "", "ja471:6.2": "Assapiṭṭhattharassukhassa → assapiṭṭhattharaṇasukhassa (bj); assapiṭṭhattharaṇaṁ sukhassa (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja471:6.3": "", "ja471:6.4": "", "ja471:7.1": "", "ja471:7.2": "", "ja471:7.3": "", "ja471:7.4": "", "ja471:8.1": "", "ja471:8.2": "", "ja471:8.3": "", "ja471:8.4": "", "ja471:9.1": "", "ja471:9.2": "", "ja471:9.3": "", "ja471:9.4": "", "ja471:10.1": "", "ja471:10.2": "", "ja471:10.3": "Addakkhi → addasa (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja471:10.4": "Bubhukkassa puṇṇaṁmukhassa → bhobhukkhassa ca puṇṇamukhassa (bj); bubhukkassa puṇṇamukhassa (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja471:11.1": "", "ja471:11.2": "", "ja471:11.3": "", "ja471:11.4": "", "ja471:12.1": "", "ja471:12.2": "", "ja471:12.3": "", "ja471:12.4": "", "ja471:13.1": "Meṇḍakapañhajātakaṁ → meṇḍakapañhājātakaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed); meṇḍakajātakaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja471:0.1": "", "ja471:0.2": "", "ja471:0.3": "", "ja471:0.4": "", "ja471:1.1": "bj30.432, ms22J_2339, msdiv94, ndp22.244, pts-vp-pli4.186, sya27.336", "ja471:1.2": "", "ja471:1.3": "", "ja471:1.4": "", "ja471:2.1": "csp1ed22.252, csp2ed22.252, ms22J_2340, msdiv95", "ja471:2.2": "", "ja471:2.3": "", "ja471:2.4": "", "ja471:3.1": "ms22J_2341, msdiv96", "ja471:3.2": "", "ja471:3.3": "", "ja471:3.4": "", "ja471:4.1": "dr27.335, ms22J_2342, msdiv97", "ja471:4.2": "", "ja471:4.3": "", "ja471:4.4": "", "ja471:5.1": "ms22J_2343, msdiv98, sya27.337", "ja471:5.2": "", "ja471:5.3": "", "ja471:5.4": "", "ja471:6.1": "ms22J_2344, msdiv99", "ja471:6.2": "", "ja471:6.3": "", "ja471:6.4": "", "ja471:7.1": "ms22J_2345, msdiv100, ndp22.245, vri68.196", "ja471:7.2": "", "ja471:7.3": "", "ja471:7.4": "", "ja471:8.1": "ms22J_2346, msdiv101", "ja471:8.2": "", "ja471:8.3": "", "ja471:8.4": "", "ja471:9.1": "bj30.434, csp1ed22.253, csp2ed22.253, dr27.336, ms22J_2347, msdiv102", "ja471:9.2": "", "ja471:9.3": "", "ja471:9.4": "", "ja471:10.1": "ms22J_2348, msdiv103, sya27.338", "ja471:10.2": "", "ja471:10.3": "", "ja471:10.4": "", "ja471:11.1": "ms22J_2349, msdiv104", "ja471:11.2": "", "ja471:11.3": "", "ja471:11.4": "", "ja471:12.1": "m